### Geçerli istek
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/ticket-created
X-Webhook-Token: local-webhook-secret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "ticket.created",
  "ticketId": "TICKET-42",
  "ownerId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "title": "Support Room",
  "participantIds": ["00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"]
}

### Eksik/hatalı istek - title boş, participantIds boş liste
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/ticket-created
X-Webhook-Token: local-webhook-secret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "ticket.created",
  "ticketId": "TICKET-42",
  "ownerId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "title": "",
  "participantIds": []
}

### Geçersiz UUID - ownerId bozuk
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/ticket-created
X-Webhook-Token: local-webhook-secret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "ticket.created",
  "ticketId": "TICKET-42",
  "ownerId": "abc",
  "title": "Support Room",
  "participantIds": ["00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"]
}